  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "hey guys, its been few weeks since players in south Korea have experienced random timed outs very frequently.\n\na lot of us are tired after days of just getting kicked out of the game while we're with our friends.\n\nthis issue happens specially a lot to those users use KT networks, although users with SKT/LG also experience same issues just not as much.\n\nwhen people starts to get kicked out of the game it happens almost 10 times just in a single hour, and when that happens everyone just loses their will to enjoy this game.\n\ni know south korean vrc community isn't major in this game, but hopefully some people could help us with this issue, help us reaching the devs etc, thank you.\n\nwe all love this game very much, and it will be very great if we can enjoy it without having to crash every 10 seconds.",
